# Per-machine identity and engine address. These differ on every install - the
# lab PC, the server checkout beside it, and each workstation - so tracking them
# meant every pull overwrote the local machine's settings with another's.
# Absent is a valid, sane state: no marker means the default app identity, and
# no engine.json means http://127.0.0.1:9088.
app_instance.json
!app_instance.example.json
data/instrument-engine/engine.json
